# Everything that is either huge, secret, or rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
src-tauri/target
src-tauri/binaries
src-tauri/resources
client/dist
client/vendor
runtime/.venv
runtime/.objects
runtime/.checkpoints
runtime/agents
# THE SECRETS, EXPLICITLY. `runtime/.env` holds the Neon URL, the Google secret and the Resend key,
# and a Docker image is a tarball anybody who can pull it can read. Fly secrets are the mechanism;
# baking them into a layer would survive every rotation.
**/.env
server/.devauth.json
server/.objectkey
server/.runtokenkey
server/jaroku.db*
**/.DS_Store
.git
